WAIT 2
SCREENSHOT C:/temp/falcon_hud_edge_fa.png
WAIT 2
SCREENSHOT C:/temp/falcon_hud_edge_fc.png
WAIT 2
SCREENSHOT C:/temp/falcon_hud_edge_fe.png
WAIT 2

